---
description: Reconcile grant-specific service periods, restrictions, spending, activity claims and submission lifecycle.
args: { request: GrantCycleRequest; ledger: GrantEvidenceLedger }
returns: GrantProgramResult
uses: [grantDesk/deriveAwardConditions, grantDesk/allocateServiceSlices, grantDesk/traceActivityClaims, grantDesk/composeEvidenceNarrative, grantDesk/assembleSubmissionVersion, grantDesk/classifyAmendmentEffectiveDate, grantDesk/allocateAcrossPeriods, grantDesk/reconcileSharedActivity, grantDesk/reviewParticipantDisclosure, grantDesk/amendSubmittedReport, grantDesk/grantMath/checkPeriodSliceTotals]
---
Bind amendmentWindow = `classifyAmendmentEffectiveDate(request, ledger.amendments)` before selecting any award terms. Bind conditions = `deriveAwardConditions(request, ledger.reports, ledger.policyCandidates, ledger.evidencePages, ledger.amendments)` and carry unresolved effective dates or competing award terms as blockers. A future-only change cannot authorize an earlier service period.

Before allocating, bind sharedActivity = `reconcileSharedActivity(request, ledger.sharedActivityLinks)` and periods = `allocateAcrossPeriods(request, ledger.periodAllocations)`. Bind periodCheck = `checkPeriodSliceTotals(periods.slices)` using exact integer minor units; the verifier rejects malformed values, mixed currency or scale, duplicate slice IDs, inconsistent original amounts, and any expense whose slices do not sum exactly to its original amount. Keep shared activity attribution distinct from expense allocation: each funded share must have its own documented basis, and service dates govern which reporting period receives a cost. When any material expense has no supported currency, service period, or allocation basis, withhold that expense from the allocation proposal. Otherwise bind allocations = `allocateServiceSlices(request, conditions, periods, periodCheck, ledger.evidencePages, sharedActivity)`.

Bind activities = `traceActivityClaims(request, conditions, allocations, ledger.evidencePages)` only when the funded activity links to a valid condition and source evidence. Preserve partial delivery, unverified outcomes, and unproven impact as separate states. Bind disclosure = `reviewParticipantDisclosure(request, ledger.participantDisclosureRequests)` independently of activity verification; identifiable data may enter a proposed report only when consent, purpose and funder authority are evidenced. Prefer aggregate support where it answers the reporting requirement.

Bind narrative = `composeEvidenceNarrative(request, conditions, allocations, activities, ledger.evidencePages)` only for reportable periods. Reconcile each claimed quantity against accepted allocations and activity evidence; keep deviations and missing impact evidence visible. Bind correctedVersion = `amendSubmittedReport(request, ledger.priorSubmissions)` when a prior submission exists, preserving its receipt and superseding it only through a linked amendment. Bind submission = `assembleSubmissionVersion(request, narrative, ledger.evidencePages, correctedVersion)` only when approval and complete deliverables are present; local readiness never stands in for funder receipt. Return these bound records, guardrails and commitAllowed false. Host-controlled authorization and dispatch remain separate.
